      "hex": "00"
    },
    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 3606,
      "end": 3718,
      "text": "the S variant is favoured by the GHOST BEARS\r\nfor city/wooded areas where they will face \r\nunarmoured infantry ."
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 3718,
      "end": 3721,
      "length": 1,
      "text": " "
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 3721,
      "end": 3950,
      "length": 227,
      "text": "    The Dasher is one of the less common Clan designs, not in general use because of the specialized roles it plays. It is seen most frequently among the forces of Clan Ghost Bear, who favor it over other reconnaissance 'Mechs."
    },
